  "year": 2025,
  "arxivId": "2501.12948",
  "abstract": "This paper introduces DeepSeek-R1, a large language model that achieves remarkable reasoning capabilities through pure reinforcement learning (RL) without relying on supervised fine-tuning as a preliminary step. DeepSeek-R1 demonstrates strong performance on various reasoning tasks, including mathematics, coding, and scientific reasoning, and its distilled versions outperform other open-source models.",
