      "title": "How It Works",
      "content": "DeepSeek-R1 uses Group Relative Policy Optimization (GRPO) as the RL framework to improve model performance in reasoning. The model is trained using a rule-based reward system, which evaluates the accuracy of responses and encourages the model to produce readable and coherent Chains of Thought (CoT). <strong>Key terms: GRPO, Rule-based Reward System, Chain of Thought (CoT)</strong>",
